"""One event from the durable event log."""
type Event {
  """
  Who caused it: {kind, ref}. Null when the emit site attributed nobody — preserved rather than defaulted, so an unattributed event is visible as one.
  """
  actor: JSON

  """The operation-key history that led here."""
  causationChain: [String!]

  """"""
  createdAt: DateTime!

  """
  The registry name, e.g. "RECORD_CREATED" — SCREAMING_SNAKE, the same string a hook subscribes to. Only project-plane events appear on this stream.
  """
  event: String!

  """"""
  id: String!

  """
  The flat event keys, plus `state` and `stateSchema`. `state` is self-contained (the resource AS OF the event, not a pointer to current state) for user, session and operation events. It is null for record.* events, whose payload is the {recordId, modelKey, tenantId, projectId} pointer: record data is governed by owner, grant, borrow and per-field terms that a copy in the event log would escape, so read the record back under your own credentials.
  """
  payload: JSON!

  """
  Monotonic position in this project's stream, assigned in COMMIT order. Store the highest one you have processed; pass it back as `after` to resume.
  """
  seq: EventSeq!
}

