"""
The user riding along with the credential. Reported because it CHANGES the authority: GetAuthority unions the user's role onto the anonymous baseline.
"""
type WhoamiUser {
  """"""
  id: String!

  """
  The keys of the roles the user holds here, now: across the project, and in the organization they stand in. A key names a role and grants nothing: use it to decide what to show, and authority.effective for what the user may do. Null when the platform did not say, which `unreported` names; an empty list means the user holds no role.
  """
  roles: [String!]

  """The user's ROLE's permissions, as they arrived."""
  scopes: [String!]
}

